  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "关于沫若先生，据我看，至少有五方面值得赞述：",
      "output_sha256": "d4ab98d105b5ac1e1047fd113fe4ff0eeff1fa9d6f2c4874ab390863940f2ca3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4ab98d105b5ac1e1047fd113fe4ff0eeff1fa9d6f2c4874ab390863940f2ca3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（一）他的文艺作品的创作及翻译；",
      "output_sha256": "50e35bdc0f472fdb62038322bddb945d4f22e3650c0f40d2158b06905d45339a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "50e35bdc0f472fdb62038322bddb945d4f22e3650c0f40d2158b06905d45339a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "第二，他在北伐时期的革命成就；",
      "output_sha256": "bdd9a7496301c0c3d725f7824238133bd383a68b1acb31b4e2a857f5b4499479",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.560773,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fa9bc7a776a7a6e367397fed7b1eeefda459df324e80f426df98c4d2c0053e58"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bdd9a7496301c0c3d725f7824238133bd383a68b1acb31b4e2a857f5b4499479",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（三）他在考古学上的成就；",
      "output_sha256": "9b5fe4338a36f2351e4b81aa246a491b8bed808e31a437fef6d72f163e83e677",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b5fe4338a36f2351e4b81aa246a491b8bed808e31a437fef6d72f163e83e677",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "第四，自抗战以来，他的抗战工作；",
      "output_sha256": "f61ad9ecbad0a6f0c6c2f6eea394fe78a8bf13d6e3d44a4ab7ce66a9a8f235be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.806731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "261a5b865ec0b3435028e0ac1d270f0e036503487b18c898679b369d54ee9b01"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f61ad9ecbad0a6f0c6c2f6eea394fe78a8bf13d6e3d44a4ab7ce66a9a8f235be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（五）他的为人。",
      "output_sha256": "b164a3c604f6e74d03313c29c885908c6ed81279ff9c8741ec93052ded3afcc3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "b164a3c604f6e74d03313c29c885908c6ed81279ff9c8741ec93052ded3afcc3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "对于上述五点，实在让我感到无从谈起，因为：",
      "output_sha256": "f821fc5ccb6592e60b17714f7f3fd25cbb2f5a4f10beb944b1780ac6b37aabb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.384091,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8f2c497fe37fa4eb9545bcd27884a7acb5575f180314b93cab0a2bd5b61c2cd3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f821fc5ccb6592e60b17714f7f3fd25cbb2f5a4f10beb944b1780ac6b37aabb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "首先，关于他的文艺作品和翻译，我并未全部读过，因此不敢妄加评论；而想要将他的著作一一搜集并深入研究，现在显然也不太可能。",
      "output_sha256": "10426a8c6461bf2d855949159a164c5397d11d1793baf3bbfac48d3ef097597a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.440358,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "593cf689c6d453b0a8a49fabc7eb5ba59ffbc86ab0445692b218cccf3e4b53c1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "10426a8c6461bf2d855949159a164c5397d11d1793baf3bbfac48d3ef097597a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（二）关于北伐时期他的革命工作，他自己已经写出了一点；以后他还许有更详细的自述，用不着我替他说；要说，我也所知无几。",
      "output_sha256": "5e9c2dd4a10d75da2452faa44fecbd284a826e014c685810e742dd7fadaa592d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "5e9c2dd4a10d75da2452faa44fecbd284a826e014c685810e742dd7fadaa592d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（三）对于他的考古学的成就，我只知道：遇有机会，我总是小学生似的恭听他讲说古史或古文字。",
      "output_sha256": "8391cce8077859069148054047bebb51fdc7610f25395b7f84b8d98b44fa108f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "8391cce8077859069148054047bebb51fdc7610f25395b7f84b8d98b44fa108f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因为，据专家们说：今日治考古学的人们可分为三类，第一类是学有家数，出经入史，根底坚深，但不习外国言语，昧于科学方法，用力至苦而收获无多。",
      "output_sha256": "4c845a5114bd8f7442a5d51b5e460b0a00d784374678cf8d85e5adc2c8224d65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c845a5114bd8f7442a5d51b5e460b0a00d784374678cf8d85e5adc2c8224d65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第二类是略知科学方法，复有研究趣味，而旧学根底不够，失之浮浅。",
      "output_sha256": "eaec2efaa5a002da3662e1e080abc596d501b0a9f1f48e4b510b965bd9425036",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "eaec2efaa5a002da3662e1e080abc596d501b0a9f1f48e4b510b965bd9425036",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第三类是通古知今，新旧兼胜，既不泥古，复能出新，研究结果乃能照耀全世。",
      "output_sha256": "24e8ffb0d50842c92cfe787d61af95563390746c92e7c8816a8fa59b6ee27dd3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "24e8ffb0d50842c92cfe787d61af95563390746c92e7c8816a8fa59b6ee27dd3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "沫若先生被认为属于第三类，我只能信任专家们的评价。",
      "output_sha256": "d6b666034b19b386df81448a9164435ecbfceccc3c2d2c28c6e60f4e8b8a3519",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.596132,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "efda56c34f45f822b4e71844b66234684d06cb9b757e169773ff5a38773cd6e3",
        "b0b083a3923f6689ae77a49a88247424f25b5b14700e6f810f20b31158c2ea60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d6b666034b19b386df81448a9164435ecbfceccc3c2d2c28c6e60f4e8b8a3519",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "当我恭听他讲述的时候，我只怀疑自己的理解力，一句类似的批评的话也不敢说——一个外行怎敢去批评内行们所推崇的内行呢？",
      "output_sha256": "6b6bfe1f0892127fe49e856e441869886c3510cafb948abc565421b90123d361",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "6b6bfe1f0892127fe49e856e441869886c3510cafb948abc565421b90123d361",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（四）至于抗战来，他的抗敌工作，是眼前的事情，人人知道，我并不比别人知道的多到哪里去，也就用不着多开口。",
      "output_sha256": "560e0f4abeadee8990f04ed83581cfa944390c893f9e5b015f6239057066192d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "560e0f4abeadee8990f04ed83581cfa944390c893f9e5b015f6239057066192d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "关于他的为人，我同样没有资格评论，因为我与他相识不过四年。",
      "output_sha256": "c4e282e392769e48323b37f0caf24b058a33b63c7477e889fbe9e70cd1f7217e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.629083,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6fdcf0ae8da7c797b8d82766ffbcf414ec208da7dcaccc5fb3fdc9d3b8edd393"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c4e282e392769e48323b37f0caf24b058a33b63c7477e889fbe9e70cd1f7217e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不过一位新闻记者既可以由一面之缘而写印象记，那么，相识四年，还不可以放开胆子么？",
      "output_sha256": "203fe21832e14b6685dcbcf5b5f594f6f7f77c414d079bafb51963b70dbe763b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "203fe21832e14b6685dcbcf5b5f594f6f7f77c414d079bafb51963b70dbe763b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "根据这个聊以自解的理由，我现在要说几句没有什么资格来说的话。",
      "output_sha256": "710a5c0e19cd33d81bba857579fd694cdab0aa3d623802e83ebbf3055cdd7701",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "710a5c0e19cd33d81bba857579fd694cdab0aa3d623802e83ebbf3055cdd7701",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "经过四年的观察，我觉得沫若先生是一个：",
      "output_sha256": "a25ebf77f0894f856caec6ee3764acf673090e9094009aa17bfab30910fd39d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.760053,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8eb957f2a27b3e5f51bb7767e42c90dc5bd02206a64026396dfb5d67d669073d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a25ebf77f0894f856caec6ee3764acf673090e9094009aa17bfab30910fd39d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（一）绝顶聪明的人，这里所说的“聪明”，并不指他的多才多艺而言，因为我要说的是他的为人，而不是介绍他在文艺上与学术上的才力与成就。",
      "output_sha256": "f14703c23d49729d16ecd1fcc6bfc5b40d1f1e796e11c01b47627ed19b74d39c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "f14703c23d49729d16ecd1fcc6bfc5b40d1f1e796e11c01b47627ed19b74d39c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我说他是绝顶聪明，因为他知道他自己的天才，知道自己的成就，知道他自己的地位，而完全不利用它们去取得个人的利益与享受。",
      "output_sha256": "650a3922c941e922cd011f51ca95e1bd3f6a2544ab0015c14da4ba8bb6b97ba6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "650a3922c941e922cd011f51ca95e1bd3f6a2544ab0015c14da4ba8bb6b97ba6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "相反，他总是希望将自己的才华用在他认为有意义的事情上，即使因此遭受重大的物质损失和身心痛苦，他也毫无怨言！",
      "output_sha256": "a6f9372ce3896c39018e8ebd3946e4ac2aa111b34df6c81db60b12eb63d29d4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.549617,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "512016ca040f29bfb5769392466b9464b1c6dedc3b081eb8c96c272f2cb60c15"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6f9372ce3896c39018e8ebd3946e4ac2aa111b34df6c81db60b12eb63d29d4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他敢去革命，敢去受苦，敢从日本小鬼的眼皮下逃回祖国，来抵抗日本小鬼！",
      "output_sha256": "47e1b5389ecf461c2561393c27726e9bcfcb892203ba48dbbe22e9fd1db53e59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "47e1b5389ecf461c2561393c27726e9bcfcb892203ba48dbbe22e9fd1db53e59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我管这叫作愚傻的聪明，假若愚傻就是舍利趋义的意思的话。",
      "output_sha256": "5e4e29e42addbc584ef7080d4fec6fccada6117636f5aef2875b847e0a11c762",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "5e4e29e42addbc584ef7080d4fec6fccada6117636f5aef2875b847e0a11c762",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这种聪明才是一个诗人的伟大处：有了它，诗人的人格才有宝气珠光。",
      "output_sha256": "9f5963c899aa03cf7fe151882997b18373fc474a12348f26ee4635543cf6624d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f5963c899aa03cf7fe151882997b18373fc474a12348f26ee4635543cf6624d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其次，沫若先生就像个五十岁的孩子，他永远保持着那种天真和热情，让人看到他的笑容、愤怒和和蔼，而很难察觉他的真实年龄。",
      "output_sha256": "5350ed72c465740df3bd681ba50b5a734bc5d736ff93b0d5569f725f8b607ab6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.531993,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5c7b12d702acedf3a1638eb6f884647e4d1258cb3c398bcf7552373ed286d8bf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5350ed72c465740df3bd681ba50b5a734bc5d736ff93b0d5569f725f8b607ab6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他始终真诚，哪怕因为真诚而受骗时，他也会愤怒——他的愤怒从不掩饰。",
      "output_sha256": "13bc20c99e125c64ae2da57c3cab074e1cd2b695e04fa5427c78a9932702f0fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.492996,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f2936dad62242f6e2c4877c369453567a37ed811936114bfbe28e6f37d8c7c72"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "13bc20c99e125c64ae2da57c3cab074e1cd2b695e04fa5427c78a9932702f0fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个脾气使他不能自已的去多知多闻，对什么都感觉趣味；假若是他的才力所能及的，他便不舍昼夜的去研究学习，他写字，他作诗，他学医，他翻译西洋文学名著，他考古……而且，他都把它们作得好；他是头狮子，扑什么都用全力，等到他把握到一种学术或技艺，他会像小孩拆开一件玩具那么天真，高兴，去告诉别人，领导别人；他的学问，正和他的生命一样，是要献给社会、国家、与世界的。",
      "output_sha256": "ff3e54271e0750ab56786b6c9c9257fdd0ed53ef74bd427288894ffeec69b0ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff3e54271e0750ab56786b6c9c9257fdd0ed53ef74bd427288894ffeec69b0ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "对待他人也如此，虽然不能满口应允，但凡他能做到的，他都会尽心尽力帮助。",
      "output_sha256": "1b9f8b3ea18896a64e5efca3d4e24b0b12b204e82a7e81a0aefd9b57676bd4b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.550411,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f3fb0e52db713aae30c70dd92c87fbc65dbcd7189b47f1a39bdee0426e837a83"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1b9f8b3ea18896a64e5efca3d4e24b0b12b204e82a7e81a0aefd9b57676bd4b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "最使我感动的是他那种随时的，真诚而并不正颜厉色的，对朋友们的规劝。",
      "output_sha256": "d94afddd5d5e0a34d8a9d639985687231a4866895f3dfd22a277c99cf6ff4d42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "d94afddd5d5e0a34d8a9d639985687231a4866895f3dfd22a277c99cf6ff4d42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这规劝，像春晓的微风似的，使人不知不觉的感到温暖，而不能不感谢他，服从他。",
      "output_sha256": "12c45f7693a878b8d2e83fb15a37e7eff7a37f7d8ffb9739093a80e5347edbb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "12c45f7693a878b8d2e83fb15a37e7eff7a37f7d8ffb9739093a80e5347edbb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "多次我注意到他对我饮酒的关心，每当我告别时，他总是低声微笑，似乎害怕伤害我的心情，说：“少喝点酒啊！”",
      "output_sha256": "ffbc942d3e9dfb2c668a61589f7ea8315fb6a326f5621c58c8572c6f1ae33c1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.512145,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34,
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d888ada816d91b9437f3419755e8890e6438c699b12bd8bb5fb555b08daa04b6",
        "df469c7745bf8531578705c7ad32c73deed81409e7c62aa9a21e54d2b8dca66a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ffbc942d3e9dfb2c668a61589f7ea8315fb6a326f5621c58c8572c6f1ae33c1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好多次了，我看见他这样规劝别人——绝不是老大哥的口气，而永远是一种极同情，极关切的劝慰。",
      "output_sha256": "79cf444c30040c74c970b2ba32e80667213adc036da7f5a10998bb7e37a1e70d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "79cf444c30040c74c970b2ba32e80667213adc036da7f5a10998bb7e37a1e70d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在我不认识他的时候，我以为他是一条猛虎；现在，相识已有四年。",
      "output_sha256": "c6c2a5380da1ceefaafe50a76962259be69d09faa0b0c056605c547cf3984072",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "c6c2a5380da1ceefaafe50a76962259be69d09faa0b0c056605c547cf3984072",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我才知道他是个伏虎罗汉。",
      "output_sha256": "b6f1a0d451fff3b68501e8eed3f5f1961dc59b8a8cbc2d3d0dc138ab2508f7f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "b6f1a0d451fff3b68501e8eed3f5f1961dc59b8a8cbc2d3d0dc138ab2508f7f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "啊，五十岁的老小孩，我相信你会继续在创作上，学术研究上，抗敌工作上，用你的聪明；也相信，你会在创作研究等等而外，还时时给我们由你心中发出的春风！",
      "output_sha256": "8c1e20d689dc453bc9539a15cc677e5f7025ca5190678f2d09929dcb81471790",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "8c1e20d689dc453bc9539a15cc677e5f7025ca5190678f2d09929dcb81471790",
